<title>UK: ICI to buy small BASF business.</title>
<headline>ICI to buy small BASF business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Imperial Chemical Industries Plc said on Monday it would buy German chemicals giant BASF AG's syngas catalyst business, which has annual turnover of about 15 million stg.</p>
</text>
